{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55492","headline":"题胡氏华林书院（题拟） · 许坚","name":"题胡氏华林书院（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽说灵踪好画图，幽奇高尚义羣居。\n山林总是神仙隐，礼乐爰修周孔书。\n解驾十年惟壮士，担簦千里结名庐。\n功成霄汉非常事，对此那堪不我欺。\n（见宣统元年刊《甘竹胡氏十修族谱》，转引自《文学遗产》一九八四年第三期刊谢先模《宋人佚诗一束》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}